{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1456,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dc9afea64738aba729ce5b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真越是进行训练，\r\n就会变得越有魅力喔。\r\n接下来要做什么训练？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d89eb4182f0d6ba0eeb654b4e89990deab43bc02b12b21f9b0342feafea8b5d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3a3d4c892f75a7a9725fd44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员想的小真专用训练内容，\r\n让我有点期待呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9514d4c4d3f20c1c89530176e32af4132519fb959627af6ffb3888dbce1fa5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ecd60e50e46bd00904acced",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦好啦，训练的时间到了。\r\n我这边也准备好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bab2a205a84e2b9f1aed319f4db77403ac047908ac38612a06e133d3c30ccec5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e867aeb0809cebefe3c1bcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要在比赛中表现活跃，\r\n就能提升被当成吉祥物喜爱的机率。\r\n加油吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33c9c659a8b0f4079e330c91f7149895b98191122e053f821432c4ce50b52f21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aab7ed0a1c911aa91a9cc722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……专心、专心。\r\n…………唔──",
      "source_fingerprint": "422af6497beaa278121d08668b22bcf34d7ceb6794c33fea4bda43271a8594ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8902888feaae7675126d8603",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要一起出门吗？\r\n光是靠唐突的邀约，\r\n可是无法打动少女心的喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7518eff5f6b7304acde0369e97a2ebb5c8d0a581223b9532575561ac315aede8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c47ca7f70e03733170b4e13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…………？咦？\r\n嗯嗯？刚才有一瞬间，\r\n世界上的时间好像消失了似的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2f8271f013207ad50f812f4e4ebb19d8784c1f713d3d6c9cc6e4d56a54a4934",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d18e30f7c524ee309d9594ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，身体好沉重……\r\n明明有好好睡午觉，\r\n却还是这样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ee9e614fe42d168c2a32e16ca7311879eed70ee6282ceb002d9e7146a8c9457",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbee5605ad66445ec61c264b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦，又要参赛吗？\r\n如果不偶尔做些不一样的事情，\r\n粉丝们也会腻吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8fa2f82ae821ff54310553a364d47e78d79da283063f85709388fa61f47184d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1940c945d1d43a50a60e4c4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……真的还要再参赛吗？\r\n……真的吗？\r\n……真～的～吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a15f9716df369d35929adc86284dec17b554e1b73b83d1d714b9591e9f17c034",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b251ca1fb3c2a12f07243624",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘周边制造商们，请看好了。\r\n小真将会证明自己是个\r\n值得推销的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "684543b47bb794e16917992af6ab60a7b0c48a7f4e0b6713af7be3e01e025574",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a359c93412b50e82c622bfc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔～观众络绎不绝……！\r\n这些人都将成为小真的粉丝……\r\n唔呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efbcabe8ec5e37c53d2130463a94689324985cb57126208cbc9220b31c4f02eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1d36dc1da8d5b773b73e97f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可以移开视线喔。\r\n因为接下来的每个场面\r\n都会是小真的精彩瞬间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1442e9ac8bf7d5f37a49b3bb61078cd2b36465167e091e4286a02417fede6be4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fe494ec435fa935e313629a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真昨天梦到\r\n自己拿下了第一名，\r\n所以有信心能够获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0d13318e4309ef2c219248d949b857fd61d733081e05b2b1c8f40a55d2bc36d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5879213f9d019a150236d6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论对手是谁，\r\n只要拿下第一名，\r\n大家自然都会关注小真。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6bde1fc6b5aebdacc26bad85683a268605d318b258142d051fe349ea9b8c25a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec6cbcd8c55c56cd650ba849",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家见识一下小真平日\r\n一点一滴累积的成果吧。\r\n强壮的小真要上场了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5580e9551290fac01e7a61edf66a7c6b918de1ee3553f3c39d517204196c76f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2319708a1783eb2fe9583205",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等比赛结束后，我会挥手。\r\n你看见后要用力双手抱胸，\r\n并露出笑容喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1f01cf479320e1011eea8b6d1a7f2d371630f67a29743e67b6153ecb36c8c19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a427752532f32fa838831d8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……集中……好了。\r\n我把力量都集中在心窝了。\r\n等进入最后直线再一口气爆发出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b6ae908cec57ada6b142b6e1325c266caf92387c84a3daa34d2a7da416237d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bd147491a001fff711ffe42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论付出了多少努力，\r\n只要没有留下好成绩，\r\n就无法获得别人的关注。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b748660c4d311432595b5f7332250eb9b0c810c691d834996a6d2ddb184047",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:887528aa1ae69c7e75fa9a12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便状态调整得并不完美，\r\n但也已经走到这一步了。\r\n……我要为今天的奔跑留下意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43496780d09178243d11018f6fe95ce6c1e22f23eba3562e2d54566e930ce4ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d9d684b1cdb5c6814fbc441",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可以在休息室检查蹄铁吗？\r\n虽然应该没问题……\r\n但我想再检查一次。",
      "source_fingerprint": "902a30922bbf14a21a005639481200ab96cf38d47f78453d0096983225276fe7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24e35919a5234914bb488de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我心里还是会有不安。\r\n但这不代表我可以在这里落败。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7f53a323d450ff3e550c0fd63e1dc2b67d6fa71215a5077a275fa975805b34f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee919b71a23f51497c263fbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……心脏跳得好快，真是碍事。\r\n冷静下来吧，一定没问题的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf84016f9080b59062de4f330625ff09c8a7a71ae4c577e8b655e480a16eb5ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75f01233c246274de8a1ab12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会竭尽全力，直到最后一刻。\r\n……我不想就这样、被埋没。",
      "source_fingerprint": "618adc31235593e022f27fe2a777e429feb427fbf3b93d1b30d425489135a865",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:905ab4a52a8cfdfc609b915f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难受时才更要站稳脚步。\r\n这是关键的一战。\r\n只要撑过去就会有商机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b2f37a32788353eac269b4360b7883fc6b9bbc917b6754e8f455f34a2cb9bb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:170af68d151f6c98178c973b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～",
      "source_fingerprint": "055afe339cd4865e65ab35abd460bf34d7042d1791d77a932832ea2d4f7e30bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ab7aa6ef3469a19449ded69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c7a9f97adb5bed9d4c6aca666dffd0e37fda970ebcfc2c8c0060523a483e295",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4efb765eaf4a4e1d07520fce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50f188e86f3a8e4b11e3889195a5e78696dec7efbbec196eb54940fe3288b9a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3451ba14efa6c424c039a77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来念书吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56a8ab96367f1fecd8a5597a31d41e49058a905ae254b66853db9c081ae88db3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3d9a1c591effd3da23a283e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff2fc41fc2a37ee08441f40c67d9ba7a9c82aa96fa79524ef44330e764709db9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b17a27301cdc7902f682194",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86da1b53b8e9030921223d1116840eec3ad77bbe410b4f3802da0abd63a8d247",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fe8863d1701f00cd26d269c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要出门了呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "382de79e5af87cfa84fea453698c0c59f570bac174669c44123c53cce6f366b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69539829490edf894a2f9a57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦，是大海……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f264985c2db982e72c4077c46e7dc57047b700dec1756517127b77c9d5fb65ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97714f324704a67dde814426",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得留下了美好的回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b1ed91bf8b9fd0e47d8593bda3a938c7c56cde182112eb687c13bdaf1ba1d09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db69b4a6170af3aa78340b46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60cea5bec86c043fd19dbea36436c0f3b9c4fe2202fcdb74cfb046ace865c13f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:948250f012f32942f63b6e2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帮手小真登场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ece2e686b5ec3c4a914c99658ff232de8b8334c78da9fa3d3e5f000937b7fe20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2204643352da3428b3d5f947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，我们走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61a54c3e0a4c22fa18eec40b86616d9118dd4aacb049d8ce94a1df739a4dfd66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:805ae8094bb808a441c92417",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来大家都到齐了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72851e94c3f899ed022c2d4757cf5498bac92a8c408510eddeed0fe09b52603b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:345466cbbc5d18722f9b4882",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60cea5bec86c043fd19dbea36436c0f3b9c4fe2202fcdb74cfb046ace865c13f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:047292eb21497664a5c27403",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家见识一下小真平日\r\n一点一滴累积的成果吧。\r\n强壮的小真要上场了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5580e9551290fac01e7a61edf66a7c6b918de1ee3553f3c39d517204196c76f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f402dc2ac0bd77ef27a4ede1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可以移开视线喔。\r\n因为接下来的每个场面\r\n都会是小真的精彩瞬间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1442e9ac8bf7d5f37a49b3bb61078cd2b36465167e091e4286a02417fede6be4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8e4d7dbc65795d81c3d2744",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60cea5bec86c043fd19dbea36436c0f3b9c4fe2202fcdb74cfb046ace865c13f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6421668f38fc821ece8bbec1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a33be5d182910b07f33d048e963b267fea02b8cc4bafdbc2bfce1f5574ee935",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a930e5ce0676b133665578e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "第二名……下次获胜会很有戏剧性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43f8d43718bbf174a4648619e2ae5485a7548cc80252c4fba8a50215b1beb545",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98ee912cec514088fcf396e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还在成长当中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b4b6e467f833f12d6d094b5b45c946469ff9acacb086117f8adad4808a1e670",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fae96dc150d9f37e40630141",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔。我本来以为可以表现得更好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "290eaac8e9be1a41e3d346754a21eb2166656c4f939e9734f18171bd50074296",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dab8fd8c5213fdfcc9f6f18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真下次会用结果来推销自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a144819688eda60a92112dc9c48fbf81745b16aeb4f86e8b52c3a0605c164794",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22bf4f141746a22ada857b19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有跑出令人难忘的表现吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d773f35fddc73e697fde2b1416a175363d216312eb9a499e3e1084637ebb7f0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e60b95eb4003c9b1d01b51f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有感到兴奋或是雀跃吗？有吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a8e7767814c64ae70f2bbc240e037818baf428f41301a77cac365597bf71131",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bcd191bb83ad11fc9b81fd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这份甜甜的时光，是否传达到了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "80923b70550632ee0a5c457e78c3247673fec5e632749af6f2bdd11da12128ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3ca35f14dd0fb2c9b17d1a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心跳加速了？心动不已了？对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8aa70b44e507e8175bbc496d925b66c3bdc0ae408de21e31e613643bd909834",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bdff728387a28254b577a75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，我会加油的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e84b25aa3248ad1e2b6ccbbad3d20a38859abffb337db7b7c8cf2a47f3318116",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb12636c7688c9ac4c17fda4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可以错过我的表现喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b468eb4093af9a371d38cca0267f6b258de894308219dcf31dc9dea9f54aa3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3dee4e4123e8556c0b53069",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要行动，我要前进！\r\n朝着快乐情人节目不斜视地\r\n横步前进。！‌",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb0b458165500b8830494d882bb4f901cd9c860bcb27a7100b49444bad1db45b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17464ec22cd0a8cb6835b1c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真觉得，那个人\r\n其实还挺粗神经的，\r\n所以不用太担心哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "936171ed84f8b286e3869a82aa8b3bfe4a5dd4ae53acd48f780cfa38dc227fa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7993ba86ca69efdb0b118eca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起保持比V状态……\r\n再保持“耶”状态……为了呈现\r\n精彩的抓拍时刻，继续努力锻炼吧！‌",
      "source_fingerprint": "72a2bae8885ff18f392e3bcd8e38e00ed93b3b41d6468938ede9d7ff01943c9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72a650c5e0028db08ecb5d66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "留下，被留下。\r\n在这美好的时代，和大家相遇了。\r\n对于这一切的爱……深表感激。‌",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4b13c7d4e1b79a905d638251028da059bce6aaca648a52ba00ec3323ad6db60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:019f249aa245b926fe4fb632",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所谓的灵感，都需先经过一番耐心\r\n等候才会出现…………叮咚～\r\n小真也想到了新的周边商品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d521de959f7bf41ddbbf450dbb8d4ca7c44347f8e4935f89d1ad679424dcb0a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c69098cdaa13f191238b84d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，小真在这里。\r\n要一直追上来，不可以跟丢喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ed38c5c351c93a1f847ff873b0c57007eee947ff68644b91d55aea16c83a45c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c24ab49f01abf5c60e40e3b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "答答答啦～♪答答答啦～♪\r\n答答答答，答答答答～♪\r\n这是来自谬斯的祝福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72958ddb86c7f56e697cbdb3338efcb5ffd7200432b969d45fca47a1fcb4a8a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8e828712094ab279c9cbdc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇……！\r\n一直在一起呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98cac9283cca7d84cc2b48805e31ceb061edcb0540eeca97d837a03a015961bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21cb13e2776210636b515ec4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯♪\r\n她是我最重要的朋友……\r\n无论何时，都能发现我的存在♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "21e3c574513dfd59d38e4b1e2617cf856793cc7dd0e0554450b9c35d5f90ae2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:548e561189006fe4ed6d987c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是用眼睛或耳朵都好，\r\n尽情感受小真吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "986b55b65580511a8e337e193515c39c35d26445b4927ab14aacc3b4794d2c5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc698bb18a555cadd0dbc5f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要留下许多痕迹，\r\n放心不会痛的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74aa4d0f23726b6427776f7be242995493e28c0f174fe19396094af6fea39174",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b407d0ee0edb9685cffc22d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有在好好看着我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "681375461cf0997afff5043839f04a54fa6f0a712bb5b4ba0183c48ac5159fa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:370d5a1b7436ac87ab91c03a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经决定好自传的\r\n第一行要写什么了……\r\n呵呵，训练员你知道答案吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "786c0d5429d1af332a25c82519d927a20d9a099612d484c57eb17f69fac8ce26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c9208914de73b6f7708da75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真穿制服也很可爱吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "61433ee7b98b140a398586e0216caed5bf7be44a7cdbdf3dadc4dcdf67e8d4e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40bb8d3656937a1a44839ce9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀？要开始练习演唱会吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a40b6aedfc03860a0d31830da09cf74b219a8c42695c6cbe23f90bd8c6e901",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10d9d81256ec8f31d3e5c0f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿上这件决胜服，即便在赛场上\r\n也能很容易认出小真了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bccb33a48d0782ac8e28d9360399dff59e3ad079c8faec7980e20dbc040f1f80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:912b750a07526458ea2abe59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每天早上都会烫缎带。\r\n毕竟无法确定什么时候会是我\r\n最后一次拍照嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9647f58d339baa986140f45c2891128d248a0335d0278d5fd7e722065f5706b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec0100bd7885438011d92cd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演唱会就是一场考验，\r\n考验着唱歌跳舞的功力和口才。",
      "source_fingerprint": "036b9f7e86c27a32c0bc5db304ce10ae4a3965e0512452ac5c3b0b1f0e56d19b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8bd4e99bc88cf5b834ff947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是参考我的形象，\r\n只属于我的服装……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b6e44a0e8da7ccb0af862bd0f80ec07a5867f27e08ad0af0196ef1188e0ba61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3efec5927fb47440a3438c79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要摸一下这件衣服吗？\r\n会让你很难忘的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "37d81280de59dd39d6d87e76243ecf6b80dcce8436338315b0b875e95e9759b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2115a0505f9a08487d2c2119",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，其实头冠也是特制的哦。\r\n你看你看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6dfc8e865d2b46501b7baee79eb3ac75f3aec1dd475c1deef8f22102b9cd6a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d07e0a236b6c53a29eb849",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真的换衣时间～",
      "source_fingerprint": "411fd1b233c3acf73977c43b13316a1a6bb89a474a4afb9e0aa359374313ba80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:598af8bc2d06ba0300309810",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次就用这套服装出周边吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfc016df16c8e567f0300e27660a8296319ad55d1bc6adf3718d35fc232a3608",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de47220226c512878892f31d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯~脑袋滋滋的。\r\n没法冷静下来……呼呣。失礼了。\r\n可以借用一下训练员的手吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa3a5cadd0b50cb24fb8fbd39158cef007145c3c5124160712bafd5bbcd116df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d3a77d84db61b235e878f16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服也好决胜服也好私服也好\r\n小真就是小真。\r\n永远都是小真。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e69d4cc8aefd22cd9e7fbcbc096aa0c57962bad181b8fe099c3d7c51fccf6dbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac90876ebf46d2d70640c0c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真穿制服也很可爱吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "61433ee7b98b140a398586e0216caed5bf7be44a7cdbdf3dadc4dcdf67e8d4e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5c5b30203a05292d30a4755",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀？要开始练习演唱会吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a40b6aedfc03860a0d31830da09cf74b219a8c42695c6cbe23f90bd8c6e901",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71008"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
